<http://example.org/ofbiz/0.1/service/getOrderAvailableReturnedTotal> ofbiz:description "Get the total amount of all returns for an order: orderTotal, returnTotal - totals so far.  availableReturnTotal = orderTotal - returnTotal - adjustment.  Used for checking if the return total has gone over the order total.  If countNewReturnItems is set to Boolean.TRUE then return items in the CREATED state will be counted.  This should only be the case during quickRefundEntireOrder." .
