<http://example.org/ofbiz/0.1/service/getOrderItemInvoicedAmountAndQuantity> ofbiz:description "Determines the total amount invoiced for a given order item over all invoices by totalling the item\n            subtotal (via OrderItemBilling), any adjustments for that item (via OrderAdjustmentBilling), and the item's\n            share of any order-level adjustments (that calculated by applying the percentage of the items total that the item represents\n            to the order-level adjustments total (also via OrderAdjustmentBilling). Also returns the quantity invoiced for the item over\n            all invoices, to aid in prorating." .
<http://example.org/ofbiz/0.1/service/getOrderItemInvoicedAmountAndQuantity> ofbiz:engine "java" .
<http://example.org/ofbiz/0.1/service/getOrderItemInvoicedAmountAndQuantity> ofbiz:evidenceLine "1049"^^xsd:integer .
